<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer first quarter orders rise 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Sulzer first quarter orders rise 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group orders		   1,642	     vs 1,497</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Sulzer Rueti		   215		 vs 164</p>
<p> Sulzer Infra		   372		 vs 344</p>
<p> Sulzer Medica		  346		 vs 286</p>
<p> Sulzer Roteq		   418		 vs 357</p>
<p> Sulzer Winterthur	    266		 vs 297</p>
<p> Others, consolidation	25		  vs 49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Sulzer AG.  </p>
<p>Orders in regions;  Europe, total		  937		 vs 939</p>
<p> of which European Union    739		 vs 689</p>
<p> Switzerland		    132		 vs 204</p>
<p> North America		  299		 vs 250</p>
<p> Latin America		  113		 vs 65</p>
<p> Asia, Australia		202		 vs 180</p>
<p> Africa			   91		  vs 63</p>
<p> Total workforce		25,919	    vs 26,137</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
